  {
   "id": "nour-play-with-your-food-138619@hotfix-2023-09-12",
   "gameId": "nour-play-with-your-food-138619",
   "displayName": "Nour is Out + A Launch Day Hotfix! 🔥",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-09-12T21:28:43.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We're finally there. Nour is live on Steam! 🎉",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "After a small hiccup where an old build was set live, (Apologies about that! Please update your game if you downloaded it the morning of launch and give it another try, this time with better keyboard + mouse support. Version 1.06 is the proper launch build), our wild food art game is out into the world.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you all so much for sticking around this long. It's been a long and difficult, but very rewarding journey. And it's not over yet! We have the OST dropping piece by piece.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This project has impacted me in ways I never could've guessed. A huge thanks goes out to Panic as well, for really helping us get past that final hurdle to release. Everyone really came together to help me launch this project.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "ALRIGHT, I'll let you all enjoy your meal, but thanks again for everything. Peace!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "~Tj 🍜",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
